name unitconv
category Package
revision 55060
shortdesc Convert a length into one with another unit
longdesc This package defines two macros to convert a value with unit
longdesc into one with another unit. Supported are all TeX related
longdesc units, and also km and m. The output can be in scientic
longdesc notation for large values. The package only works with
longdesc LuaLaTeX!
